extends layout

block content
  .hero
    h1 Welcome to Study Buddy
    p A peer-support platform where students can connect, offer help, and find study sessions in a simple and supportive environment.

  .grid.grid-2
    .card
      h2.section-title Browse Students
      p View learner and mentor profiles, including course details and subject strengths.
      .actions
        a.button(href='/users') View Users

    .card
      h2.section-title Explore Sessions
      p See available study sessions, subjects, mentors, and upcoming times.
      .actions
        a.button(href='/sessions') View Sessions

  p.footer-note Designed as an improved live version of the Sprint 2 Study Buddy design.